Name: FX.CFG.COLUNA
Scope: Workbook
Source Workbook: Excel Data Framework DBB.xlsx
Source Workbook Folder: Excel Data Framework DBB__xlsx
Description: Retorna uma coluna de uma tabela a partir do nome do cabeÃ§alho.


Formula:
=LAMBDA(tabela,coluna,LET(_cabecalhos, TAKE(tabela, 1), _indice, XMATCH(coluna, _cabecalhos, 0), CHOOSECOLS(tabela, _indice)))

Localized Formula (pt-BR) - Preview Only:
=LAMBDA(tabela,coluna,LET(_cabecalhos, PEGAR(tabela, 1), _indice, CORRESPX(coluna, _cabecalhos, 0), ESCOLHERCOLS(tabela, _indice)))

Raw Formula Snapshot (en-US) - Preview Only:
=_xlfn.LAMBDA(_xlpm.tabela,_xlpm.coluna,_xlfn.LET(_xlpm._cabecalhos, _xlfn.TAKE(_xlpm.tabela, 1), _xlpm._indice, _xlfn.XMATCH(_xlpm.coluna, _xlpm._cabecalhos, 0), _xlfn.CHOOSECOLS(_xlpm.tabela, _xlpm._indice)))
